历史原manifest的payload聚合，和新的trusted aggregate分列。

@code{.json}
"1d5d4cd6e7a99282a7a049f82e758df7ba810eea07e4cb49215cfc775070ce94"
@endcode

## reconstruction

明确重构方法及SIL profile例外来源；序列化新manifest不能冒称历史原bytes。

@code{.json}
"All16 payloads from named Git tree; sil_6dof.yaml from preserved pre-canonical-mirror ROS original. New fixture manifest serialization is documented reconstruction; no claimed original raw manifest hash."
@endcode

